billed in advance, customer deposits, and advance billings for survey services. Contract liabilities are recognized as revenue when, or as, the related performance obligations are satisfied.","section":"Business Combinations","block":192,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001376474-26-000616","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-24","reportDate":"2026-09-24","cik":"0001997403","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997403/000137647426000616/zt_ex99z1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/da80f95fb7e33bafc6cc705d8886fcd23502a51fe1d9dd16ed11eed803d44252.bin","sha256":"da80f95fb7e33bafc6cc705d8886fcd23502a51fe1d9dd16ed11eed803d44252"}},{"id":"7f155e71294e49fecdb180a24822b573df2911fa1a5f1b457285b680fe9caeb3","quote":"The Company had contract liabilities of $1,784,223 as of June 30, 2026, and $1,270,958 as of December 31, 2025. The change during the year reflects billings and collections in advance of performance obligations, revenue recognized during the period from opening deferred revenue, additions from business combinations, and foreign currency translation effects. Management has not identified any material long-term contract liabilities requiring separate non-current presentation.","context":"Contract liabilities are classified as current when the Company expects to satisfy the related performance obligations within twelve months after the reporting date.","section":"Business Combinations","block":193,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001376474-26-000616","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-24","reportDate":"2026-09-24","cik":"0001997403","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1997403/000137647426000616/zt_ex99z1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/da80f95fb7e33bafc6cc705d8886fcd23502a51fe1d9dd16ed11eed803d44252.bin","sha256":"da80f95fb7e33bafc6cc705d8886fcd23502a51fe1d9dd16ed11eed803d44252